Third-party acknowledgment: stac-geoparquet
-----------------------------------------

This project acknowledges stac-geoparquet, by Tom Augspurger and its
contributors, as a design and implementation reference for storing
JSON records in Arrow and GeoParquet.

Project: https://github.com/stac-utils/stac-geoparquet
Reference inspected: release 0.8.3

The overlapping implementation patterns include:
- GeoParquet WKB metadata and bbox covering declarations.
- GeoArrow geometry field metadata.
- Batched Arrow conversion and Parquet writing.
- Collection descriptions stored in file metadata.

Related local implementations are in:
- src/ogc_records_parquet/_schema.py
- src/ogc_records_parquet/_conversion.py
- src/ogc_records_parquet/parquet.py

The upstream reference implementations are:
- https://github.com/stac-utils/stac-geoparquet/blob/0.8.3/stac_geoparquet/arrow/_to_parquet.py
- https://github.com/stac-utils/stac-geoparquet/blob/0.8.3/stac_geoparquet/arrow/_to_arrow.py
- https://github.com/stac-utils/stac-geoparquet/blob/0.8.3/stac_geoparquet/arrow/_batch.py
- https://github.com/stac-utils/stac-geoparquet/blob/0.8.3/stac_geoparquet/arrow/_util.py

